##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# Spec 039, T103 (Sampling_CropConsistent_raytrace): a jittered, depth-of-field render with
# random() shading, under the @HIDER@ hider, 64 x 48 (the template is hider-neutral; only the
# raytrace copy is registered: reyes crops are not bit-identical, GitHub #72). @SURFACE@ is
# random_probe (random() shading) or sampling_position_probe (Ci = P, T124). Generated by tests/visual/CMakeLists.txt in two
# copies: the full frame, and the same scene with CropWindow 0.25 0.75 0.25 0.75, whose pixels
# x 16..47, y 12..35 must be bit-identical to the full render's: the camera and shading draws
# are keyed by the pixel and the point, not by the region rendered. The raytrace copy uses a
# 1 x 1 box filter: with the default filter the raytrace hider's four crop-corner pixels differ
# from the full render through its filter weighting, independently of the sampler (GitHub #70).
version 3.03
Hider "@HIDER@" "jitter" [1]
PixelSamples 2 2
@FILTER@
Quantize "rgba" 0 0 0 0
@CROP@
Display "@OUTPUT@" "file" "rgba"
Format 64 48 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" 40
DepthOfField 2.8 0.5 5
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
  Surface "@SURFACE@"
  Sphere 1.5 -1.5 1.5 360
WorldEnd
